error[E0573]: invalid interface property
 --> $DIR/initializer.nra:3:24
  |
3 |     let name: string = "x";
  |                        ^^^ an interface property has no initializer
  |         ---- 'name' declares no storage
  |
  = help: remove the initializer; the class that implements the interface holds the value

